provides prognostic information</article-title><source>Urologic Oncology</source><year>2000</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>135</fpage><lpage>140</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12474528</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1078-1439(01)00185-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nassir</surname><given-names>Anmar</given-names></name><name><surname>Jollimore</surname><given-names>Jason</given-names></name><name><surname>Gupta</surname><given-names>Rekha</given-names></name><name><surname>Bell</surname><given-names>David</given-names></name><name><surname>Norman</surname><given-names>Richard</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multilocular cystic Renal Cell Carcinoma; a series of 12 cases and a review of literature</article-title><source>Urology</source><year>2002</year><volume>60</volume><fpage>421</fpage><lpage>427</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12350478</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0090-4295(02)01742-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yaycioghi</surname><given-names>Ozgur</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>WilliamW</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>Theresa</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Prognostic assessment non metastatic Renal Cell Carcinoma &#x02013; a clinically based model</article-title><source>Urology</source><year>2001</year><volume>58</volume><fpage>141</fpage><lpage>145</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11489682</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0090-4295(01)01207-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vincenzo</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Tommaso</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Giovanni</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Incidental detection beyond pathological factors as prognostic predictor of Renal Cell Carcinoma</article-title><source>European Urology</source><year>2003</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>663</fpage><lpage>669</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12767368</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>